  ('growing-older-gently', 106, 'Thank a coworker, in your head or out loud, for something you learned from working beside them.'),
  ('growing-older-gently', 107, 'Pour yourself a glass of water and sip it slowly, a small kindness for a body that has kept going all these years.'),
  ('growing-older-gently', 108, 'Write a short letter to someone younger about one thing you are glad you learned, even if you never send it.'),
  ('growing-older-gently', 109, 'Write down one thing about this stage of life that nobody warned you would be so nice.'),
  ('growing-older-gently', 110, 'Write a note to the person you will be next winter, telling them one thing you hope they get to enjoy.'),
